# =============================================================================
# SIAM frontend — VITE_* is inlined at `pnpm build` (not read at `pnpm start`).
# Never put secrets in VITE_* — they ship in the browser bundle.
# See docs/frontend-developer-guide.md §8 and docs/api-convention.md §11.
# =============================================================================

# --- Local dev (`pnpm dev`) ---
# Browser: same-origin /api/v1 → Vite proxy → Nest (vite.config.ts)
VITE_API_BASE=/api/v1
# Nest listen port — must match siam-api PORT (default 5000)
VITE_API_PROXY_PORT=5000
# SSR: absolute API origin when VITE_API_BASE is a path (default http://localhost:<proxy port>)
# VITE_API_SSR_ORIGIN=http://localhost:5000
# Canonical site URL for sitemap.xml / robots.txt (default http://localhost:3000)
# VITE_SITE_ORIGIN=http://localhost:3000

# --- Production preview (`pnpm build` + `pnpm start`, same host as API proxy) ---
# Keep path base + SSR origin pointing at a reachable API (no Vite proxy on start):
# VITE_API_BASE=/api/v1
# VITE_API_SSR_ORIGIN=http://127.0.0.1:5000
# VITE_SITE_ORIGIN=http://127.0.0.1:3000

# --- Cross-host production (static/SSR app on app.example.com, API elsewhere) ---
# Browser must use full API URL; API CORS must allow credentials for admin cookies:
# VITE_API_BASE=https://api.example.com/api/v1
# VITE_SITE_ORIGIN=https://app.example.com
# VITE_API_SSR_ORIGIN=https://api.example.com
